<title>USA: Transamerica Corp names treasurer.</title>
<headline>Transamerica Corp names treasurer.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transamerica Corp on Monday named Mark McEachen as the company's new treasurer.</p>
<p>McEachen, 38, comes from Chrysler Corp where he held various positions including treasurer of Chrysler Canada.</p>
<p>Transamerica said in a statement McEachen succeeds Robert Lindberg, who retired earlier this year.</p>
